    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "ELE_net's first Introduction to Academic Writing online course in 2019 has been running since 22 January, and it is now in its final week. Participants who enrolled in this course come from different AKU programmes and campuses, including Pakistan, Tanzania, Uganda, and the UK."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This is a 4-week course and gives students a great opportunity to be introduced to the academic writing style, and the chance to work hands on to develop their ability to write an academic essay. It is especially suited to students starting their studies at AKU. "
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Students are guided in the process of writing the introduction, the main body and conclusion of an essay. They also practise the academic language and style required through interesting interactive activities and videos."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If you feel you need support to develop your academic English skills, please "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "book your seat now on our next cours",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "http://www.aku.edu/ele-net/students/Pages/academic_writing.aspx",
                    "target": "_self",
                    "linktype": "url",
                    "uuid": null,
                    "anchor": null,
                    "custom": {}
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "e!"
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
